d steady Torch. Last-rise+500us latch and first-rise+nominal deadline are explicit model policies. No LEDC waveform, EN PWM, dynamic S1, reset-callback guarantee, analog/electrical/optical/current/thermal or bit-exact equivalence. Guest and Web validation must bind the exact host/firmware/runtime; none is inherited from C tests.", "input_semantics": "S1 is an explicit synthetic creation fixture, frozen after all initial values; flash-mode true is Flash, false is Torch. No live S1 setter.", "output_semantics": "Read-only controller state. output-known plus route and pad synchronization qualify active. Relative Flash code is not luminance; Torch uses no Flash code/deadline.", "limitations": ["Partial nominal digital model: only qualified GPIO bitbang HI/LO 750..10000ns and steady Torch. Last-rise+500us latch and first-rise+nominal deadline are explicit model policies. No LEDC waveform, EN PWM, dynamic S1, reset-callback guarantee, analog/electrical/optical/current/thermal or bit-exact equivalence. Guest and Web validation must bind the exact host/firmware/runtime; none is inherited from C tests.", "No calibrated outer-shell S1 detent binding or LED color temperature measurement.", "UNIT-HOST-36 reset-observer gap remains open; a mismatched pad revokes output-known."], "research_snapshot": {"scope": "protocol research only; not current runtime capability", "model_status": "planned", "runtime_status": "planned", "blocker": "Partial nominal digital model: only qualified GPIO bitbang HI/LO 750..10000ns and steady Torch. Last-rise+500us latch and first-rise+nominal deadline are explicit model policies. No LEDC waveform, EN PWM, dynamic S1, reset-callback guarantee, analog/electrical/optical/current/thermal or bit-exact equivalence. Guest and Web validation must bind the exact host/firmware/runtime; none is inherited from C tests."}}], "contract_hashes": {"catalog.json": "fdd14b933003c220dbbb7b8952be9c88ecd3b2793c5adda6ccf73a9fa36c3dbb", "host-ports.json": "d11181483e9ee30c